B.Jo=new A.ch("rawanda-gisanga","Rawanda Gisanga","specialty",900,"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0563/6194/3176/files/Rwanda.jpg?v=1784202040","Ruanda'n\u0131n Kongo-Nil Su Ayr\u0131m Hatt\u0131'n\u0131n y\xfcksek kesimlerinde, 1.650\u20131.850 metre rak\u0131mda yeti\u015ftirilen bu kahve, b\xf6lgenin serin ikliminden, verimli volkanik topraklar\u0131ndan ve titiz \xfcretim uygulamalar\u0131ndan beslenir.",B.Tu,B.eT,B.as,"Rawanda \u2013 Gisanga","Bourbon","Anerobic","1650-1850m","Orta-A\xe7\u0131k",null,"Ahududunun canl\u0131 meyvelemesi, g\xfcl\xfcn narin \xe7i\xe7eksi notalar\u0131yla bulu\u015fup mangonun tropikal tatl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131nda sonlanan zarif ve aromatik bir fincan.",u.s,"Bu kahvenin meyvemsi ve \xe7i\xe7eksi inceliklerini \xf6n plana \xe7\u0131karmak i\xe7in daha ince \xf6\u011f\xfct\xfcm ve hafif d\xfc\u015f\xfck su s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131yla (yakla\u015f\u0131k 90\u201392\xb0C) demlemenizi \xf6neririz.")
